SCOUTING REPORT -- ACTIVE PATROL
Rank: C | Team: Sand reconnaissance cell, two genin under one chunin

Sector: Eastern approaches to the Land of Wind, dune belt beyond the third
waystation.

Observations (this cycle):
- Fresh tracks of an unshod caravan, four to six mounts, crossing north to
  south. Not a registered Sand convoy. Possible smuggler movement -- flagged to
  the weapon-smuggling watch.
- One dry oasis previously marked as reliable; water table has dropped. Update
  the survival maps.
- No enemy-shinobi sign. Sandstorm activity light this cycle.

Recommendation: Increase patrol frequency on the eastern belt and verify the
unregistered caravan against the smuggling-policy watchlist. Water cache at the
third waystation to be resupplied before it fails entirely.

Cell remains deployed. Next report due end of cycle. Filed to active reports.
